WEBVTT

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.920
Haven't seen something this bad in a while...

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:18.140
Yes. Only a machine gun
could've done something like this.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.520
But I have no idea how they
pulled off a trick like this...

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.060
Plus, if this was an ordinary "murder,"

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.900
there'd be no reason to
demolish everything else...

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.940
Nakata-san!

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:08.660
"Turn"

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:13.250
These bullets found at the scene
were specially made for military use

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:18.800
The only place in the country that
handles it is this section of Douji.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:23.470
This isn't something that just
anybody can get their hands on.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:27.060
And all these murders were impossible
for regular people to pull off...

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:35.110
But if special military weapons
were used, then things make sense.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:41.200
Wow, you're amazing!
You're just like the detectives on TV!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:48.750
No, I'm not gonna suddenly claim
that an employee here is the killer.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.750
There's just a possibility
that there's a connection...

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:53.250
By which you mean?

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.750
That weapons were leaked,

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.670
that data was taken by an ex-employee,

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.890
that an organization
obtained it somehow, or that

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.220
Absurd. Douji's security is flawless!

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.850
Our corporate secrets would
never be leaked to the outside!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:14.560
I'll advise everyone to be even stricter
about information management.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.770
Are you done here?

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:23.740
He didn't look like he bought it
for a second. I'm sure he'll be back.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.240
He'll always get the same result.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:32.410
Douji won't ever be prosecuted.
I'm sure he's aware of that, too.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.880
He must really love wasting time.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.130
In any case, speed up the investigation.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.750
Yes, sir.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:45.510
If the "killer" this time is neither
an X-Con nor a Neo-Gene, then...

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:51.020
Any response to our report?
Zilch, as usual.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.940
Show some vigor, will ya?!

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:56.810
Eh?! Give me a break!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:01.650
Dammit... I need more definitive proof.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:05.320
Something that can't be easily suppressed...

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.200
Douji Industries is corrupt, too...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:12.500
They're supposedly connected to
politicians and top-ranking police.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.920
There's nothing we can possibly do...

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.130
Cut the crap, will ya, kid?!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.840
Bah!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.420
Tada!

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:29.550
Pretty! That totally suits you, Rihoko-Chan!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:35.730
Not too shabby. You actually did
some decent shopping for once.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:39.860
Actually, the store clerks chose most of it!

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.780
Thanks, Mom!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:47.200
It's too early to be happy! Here!

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:52.040
Don't forget the matching shoes,
socks, handkerchief, and cap!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.200
Wow...

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.910
And then there's this!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.250
Holy smokes! She's rolling in the dough!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:01.670
Hold on. Just how much did you spend today?

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:08.090
Well, I started with 1 00,000, and
there's this much left, so let's see...

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.140
Huh? It doesn't add up!

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:15.600
Hey, Mom. I really like the clothes,
but you shouldn't waste money!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:21.230
Don't be silly! I'm never
wasting money when it's for you!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.110
But...

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:29.410
It's alright! You don't have
to worry about anything at all!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:34.410
I'd do absolutely anything for you, Riko!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.410
Mom...

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.960
Okay! Come try this one on!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:44.050
Show Mom how cute Princess Rihoko can be!

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:48.970
Masamune-Chan seems unusually insecure...

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:52.390
That's for sure...
You're my daughter, all right! You're so

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.490
You wouldn't be a match for anyone like that.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:13.910
Setting aside being hit the first time,

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.580
your problem is recovering afterward.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.080
I gave you a chance to counter, you know.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:22.790
Maintain your cool and observe your opponent.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.500
Maria-sama...

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:31.800
Have confidence in yourself.
I know you can do it.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:35.560
After all, you've been chosen, just as I have.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:37.770
Right!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:48.030
I was concerned for a short while...
but she seems to be maturing well.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:52.200
This means that Maria is finally an adult.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:56.080
Splendid. If we use her as a new mother,

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:00.120
we can create an even more perfect being.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:03.880
So you want us to proceed to
the next generation of Sisters?

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:08.210
Yes. Please begin the preparations.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.510
I expect great things.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:16.430
Sisters, Sisters...

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:21.640
With the same paternal genes,
the results will always be the same.

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.940
This isn't what I want to create.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:29.940
The true Witchblade's conformant...

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.400
What sort of genes does she have?

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.990
Almost all the objects recovered
were those bullets, huh?

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.700
Talk about going all out...

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:44.790
This incident had the most
blood and objects at the scene...

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.210
Is the killer not afraid of getting caught?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.550
Or was it all purposely left there?

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:55.050
Nakata-san, here. This was
addressed to the task force.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:58.760
The contents weren't hazardous.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:07:59.890
Where's it from?!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.770
It was sent anonymously...

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:03.770
What is this?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.980
Must be some sort of data.
Who knows, maybe it's a huge tip!

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:12.070
Moron! Just check what's on 'em!

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:18.200
They appear to be video files!

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.990
I'll play them!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.210
Are they some sort of staff?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:30.500
W-What the  Is that huge thing... a monster?!

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:34.880
Their car! They seem to be
some sort of special effects crew...

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:38.300
But this is clearly in the city...

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:39.850
Stop!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:43.640
This is right next to
the scene of the fifth incident!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:47.770
This is huge...

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:51.690
Nakata-san! The media's in a frenzy!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:57.660
In these videos that seem to have
been taken at the murder scenes,

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:03.830
we can see multiple people
recovering machines of some sort.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:09.380
We received these videos from an
anonymous source this morning

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.130
W-What does this mean?!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:17.880
Have those files analyzed!
ID the cars and people, on the double!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:18.930
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:21.970
Contact the D.A. and get ready for a raid!

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.640
A raid?! Where?!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.640
You don't mean

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:32.070
That's right. These guys are
probably with Douji Industries!

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:37.860
The same videos were
simultaneously sent to all media outlets

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:44.200
and uploaded to all major Internet
news sites and message boards.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.500
What exactly are we seeing in these videos?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:54.000
People on the 'net are already
attempting to identify these vehicles.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:58.880
Some are also claiming they're
connected to the military industry.

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.800
It appears we're dealing
with a large-scale incident

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.850
Who the hell leaked?!

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.890
I can't reveal the company's name just yet,

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:12.230
but the things in these
videos closely resemble

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.940
Aren't those our I-Weapons?!

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:17.940
Does that mean they're
with the Special Section?!

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:20.320
No...

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:24.660
Yes, those videos do show our company's

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:27.370
But sir, this isn't

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:33.040
We cannot cover for you, now
that the whole world has found out!

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:37.460
The police are also poised to make a raid!

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.920
But, sir!

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.220
Sir?!

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:44.510
Damn it!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:49.480
They take all that bribe money,
but run when things get ugly!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.150
What was Takayama doing?!

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:06.240
Yagi, have you calmed down?

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.410
What's happened since?

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:14.380
We administered a tranquilizer,
which has curbed the Blade for now...

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:19.420
To think it would go
this far... Truly terrifying.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:23.260
His physical breakdown is
progressing at a rapid rate.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:27.390
At this rate, crystallized
destruction will occur within days.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:32.230
So this is the limit of
an untrained commoner...

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:37.320
Still, the Ultimate Blade
possesses such incredible power...

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:42.740
Umm, was it really a good
idea to leak those files?

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:44.030
This could become a
company-wide problem before

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:47.950
We had no choice! There was no other way!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:52.830
His escape caused us trouble we didn't need!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:04.470
It's too late to change anything now.
The die has been cast.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:12.520
We can place the full blame on
the Special Section  on Takayama!

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:32.120
U-Uhh...

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.330
Search warrant.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.140
Director Takayama.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:51.430
This time I will get a confession from you.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:03.900
The police have just raided Douji Industries!

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:07.160
The company is suspected of
attempting to cover up the fact

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:12.660
that the string of murders was a result
of a leak of its special weapons.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.500
Douji Industries has to pay
for creating murder weapons!

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:20.500
We're adamantly against Douji
Industries and its threat to the citizens!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:25.800
Production of these weapons is
handled by Douji's Special Section,

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:28.590
and it's believed that the recklessness
of its director, Mr. Takayama,

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.350
is what brought about this situation...

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:35.060
Rihoko-Chan, shows like
this must be boring for you.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:37.560
Let's go watch cartoons in my room.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.940
Okay. But...

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:44.730
No luck. I can't get through.
I guess I'll go there myself.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.740
Go? You mean to Douji?

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:50.530
Masamune-Chan!
Shouldn't you maybe go another time?

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.740
It's a real zoo over there!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.750
I won't find out anything
if I just sit here and wait.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.960
I'm just gonna check it out!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.000
Masamune-Chan!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:15.970
Heya! Way to go, Detective Nakata!

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:17.350
You're disrupting the investigation! Scram!

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:25.650
Don't be so cruel! Thanks to you
butting in, I lost my big scoop!

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:29.820
No, you were just too dumb to figure
out who was behind the killings...

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:34.330
So it was the weapons leaked
from Douji who were responsible?

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:39.660
I wouldn't say "who," since they
were runaway machines, not people.

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:41.210
Not people, huh...

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.000
Sounds like you got something to say.

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:44.920
No, nothing at all.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:48.050
So, you can't arrest the Douji guys, either?

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.930
They should get gross
negligence and manslaughter,

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:54.850
but since their weapons only got
out because of the earthquake,

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:58.060
they're going to use the Special
Earthquake Act to wriggle out of it.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.810
So that's why you're in a rotten mood, huh?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.360
I better scram before you take it out on me...

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:06.230
Hey!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:13.740
Looks like they still have
no idea X-Cons and I-Weapons

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.870
are based on people...

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:19.500
Which means my scoop isn't completely dead...

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:24.080
But if this keeps up, things could
turn ugly for Masamune too...

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:28.880
It appears that the members of
Douji Industries' Special Section

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.840
I can't believe they even have
the names of the recovery team!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:35.970
I doubt the ones caught
on tape can avoid arrest.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:39.930
The rest depends on how much
responsibility is demanded of us...

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.020
Sorry I'm late.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:47.730
Oh, Takayama, have they
finished questioning you?

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:54.360
I hate to be sudden, Takayama-kun,
but can you explain the situation?!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.740
This blunder isn't like you!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:00.830
The harm this will have on
Douji's brand is unfathomable!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:05.040
The loss from our plummeting
stock is already in the billions!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:08.670
How do you intend to get this
under control, Takayama-kun?!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.340
As one of the major
branches of Douji Industries,

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:16.840
the Special Section has maintained
enormous sway over the company.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:21.980
But it's obvious that that
one-man show is what caused this!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.890
If you don't cut down its
wildly-growing branches,

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:29.110
an entire tree's growth can be undermined!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.190
What are you so afraid of?

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.900
What?! When have I ever been

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:38.120
Wadou-san, why don't you calm down?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:42.080
Though I do understand being
shaken up by all that's happened...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.540
It's impossible for Douji's
foundation to be weakened.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:51.800
The situation today is but one
of the scenarios I anticipated.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:55.260
You mean you've already devised a strategy?!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.800
Lopping off a single branch won't kill a tree.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:01.310
Wadou-san is correct.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.940
Takayama...

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:08.400
Are you...

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.230
Let me through, please!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:16.610
Who're you?! You work for Douji or something?!

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.910
Eh?

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.280
Are you with that war-mongering corporation?!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.040
You enemy of the peace-loving citizens!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.870
Let go! When did I ever
do anything to you guys?!

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.380
What?!
What's your problem?!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.420
What're you doing?!
Eh?!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:37.090
Honestly, going through the front
door... What were you thinking?

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:39.800
But I don't know where the back door is!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:45.310
Even the employees are sneaking
out the back... You're too reckless!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:49.310
Is Douji gonna be alright?!
All this stuff has gotten out...

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:55.860
Well, big corporations have
their own unique ways to survive.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.820
Pardon the intrusion.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:03.240
Huh? Aren't you

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:07.250
Oh, aren't you the girl from the party?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:12.880
I see! So you're the Witchblade wearer.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.050
Hey, where's Takayama?

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.760
Takayama is no longer here.

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.340
What do you mean?!

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.810
So it's true that weapons
leaked from Douji Industries

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:28.230
murdered regular, innocent people?!

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:32.810
How does Douji intend to
take responsibility for this?!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.480
I have only one thing to say.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.070
All blame rests on me,

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:42.780
Takayama Reiji, head of the Special Section.

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:47.330
As such, I resign from
Douji Industries as of today.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.910
That is all.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.920
Takayama quit Douji?!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.250
Yes.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:19:02.050
All Witchblade-related affairs
are now handled by my Bio-Section.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:06.180
Segawa-kun will continue to take
care of the business side of things.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:09.680
I look forward to working
with you more, Masane-san.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.390
Hold on, now.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:15.360
So basically, I've been
switched from Takayama to you?!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.780
We require the Witchblade as well.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:23.160
There'll be a few issues until mass
production of the Ultimate Blade...

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:27.370
That means you'll still have
plenty of work, Masane-san.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.620
Isn't that great?

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.750
Screw that! I'm leaving!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.920
What about Rihoko-Chan?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:40.760
I thought you would be the most
troubled if you severed ties with us...

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:43.680
I am sure you have many feelings on the matter.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.930
But this is business, Amaha Masane-san.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:54.690
The Bio-Section promises good pay,
for you and your daughter...

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:58.150
For... Rihoko...

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:16.040
In the end, the director takes the fall
and Douji stays safe and sound...

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:19.960
The corporate world sure is cold-blooded...

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.630
Mom! Welcome home!

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.920
You're late, Masamune-Chan!
We were really worried!

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:05.680
Yeah. I had to talk about what to do now...

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:07.800
Did you see Takayama-san?

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.800
No.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.970
But everything's alright.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:17.730
You don't have to worry
about anything at all, Riko.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.230
Mom?

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.440
It's alright.

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:28.950
From now on, no matter what happens,
I'll always protect you...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:15.930
Mom, I'm just a little bit angry.

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:20.890
Your boss Takayama-san is in
big trouble... Why don't you care?

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:23.520
Why are you still working?

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:26.940
Have you already forgotten
about Takayama-san?

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:32.530
You're definitely acting strange, Mom!
You're not your usual self!

00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:39.580
Say, Mom. Don't do any
bad work for my sake. Please.
